 peanuts and eggs. If you are craving something local, they don't disappoint. Great experience to grill your own…"],["Thìa Gỗ Restaurant Da Nang","restaurant",16.05298,108.24154,"53 Phan Thúc Duyện","","","","","r","Real Vietnamese cuisine. Good food. Nice pho. Many traditional Vietnamese street food dishes done in a more comfortable setting. The location is little bit hidden. Very friendly staff."],["Torino Restaurant & Bakery","restaurant",16.04871,108.24091,"164 Châu Thị Vĩnh Tế","","","","","r","Italian food. The pizza dough is excellent."],["An's Café","bar",16.0495,108.2471,"5 Hoàng Kế Viêm","","","","","r","Recommended by Wikivoyage"]]}